    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are proud to present 23 St. Michael's Terrace to the market, a recently refurbished red brick property that is in immaculate condition throughout. In 2015 extensive works were carried out to the property resulting in a stylish and contemporary home and it is immediately obvious upon entering the house that no expense was spared during the renovation. Upgrades to the property include rewiring, plumbing, a new heating system and insulation.\n\nUpon entering the house you are greeted by a hall that leads to a front living room which features an open fireplace and under stairs storage. To the rear of the house is a contemporary kitchen where you will find an exposed brick wall - the original back wall of the house which has been re pointed. Off the kitchen is a private courtyard garden which is not overlooked in any way. Upstairs the main bedroom is light filled and offers excellent storage space. The second bedroom is to the front of the house and completing the accommodation is a modern and stylish wet room with a large walk-in shower area. There is on street parking available on St. Michael's Terrace.\n\nSt. Michael's Terrace is situated in an ultra convenient location with Dublin City Centre a mere 15 minute walk away. The Green and Red LUAS lines are also within walking distance and a number of regular bus routes travel to the city along the South Circular Road. The area enjoys some of Dublin's finest cafés and restaurants such as Noshington, Bastible, BiBi's to mention a few. Other notable amenities convenient to this property include Camden St, Griffith College Dublin, Trinity College Dublin, Griffith Barracks Multi-denominational School, St Catherines, Portobello Educate Together, St. James' Hospital, Heuston Station, The Phoenix Park and The M50 Motorway.\n\nA rare opportunity to secure a turn-key home in a highly convenient location. Early viewing advised."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room - 4.4m x 3.95m\nNewly insulated living area boasting an open fireplace in the centre of the room.\n\nKitchen/ Dining Room - 3.95m x 3.25m\nFully fitted kitchen to include a belfast sink, Bosch gas hob and oven, integrated dishwasher and under counter fridge.\n\nBedroom One - 3.95m x 3.25m\nLight filled double bedroom with ample integrated storage\n\nBedroom Two - 3.95m x 2.32m\nDouble bedroom that could also serve as a home office.\n\nBathroom - 2.01m x 1.98m\nA spacious fully tiled bathroom with it's original cast iron fireplace. Large walk in shower, W.C and Grohe basin mixer\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Beautifully refurbished two bedroom home in turn-key condition</li><li> Situated in a quiet cul de sac neighbourhood</li><li> Two double bedrooms</li><li> Measuring C. 65 Sq. M / 700 Sq. Ft</li><li> New Bosch gas central heating burner installed in 2017</li><li> Gen 3 Nest smart home heating system included</li><li> New insulated high performance immersion tank</li><li> On-Street parking</li><li> Within walking distance to Dublin City</li><li> Excellent trasnport links on your doorstep</ul>"
      },
      {
